would create a digest cycle. Act-specific support binds its exact realization and semantic identity. Reuse is allowed only for the same admitted instance association. Small scalar selections and binding descriptors may be inline; independently retrieved support and observation subjects remain separate under (`inv:actepoch:part-separation`). Exact slot, attempt, observation and binding types remain (`open:actepoch:source-selection`). realizes{``post:deployment:replay-verification``; This designs the supplied independent operand and attempted-support groups; no replay implementation or executed evidence is claimed.}

